WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.160
Episode 28

01:38.180 --> 01:39.330
That guy was shot with an arrow.

01:39.330 --> 01:40.630
He must've been seriously injured.

01:40.650 --> 01:42.350
The guards are looking for him.

01:42.370 --> 01:43.670
So why are you here

01:43.690 --> 01:45.280
instead of searching for him?

01:45.300 --> 01:47.160
I'm worried about Her Highness' safety.

01:47.180 --> 01:49.430
With me here, you have nothing to worry about.

01:49.450 --> 01:51.130
He came here for my sake.

01:51.370 --> 01:52.920
Your Highness.

01:54.620 --> 01:59.000
Xiaoyi, can I beg you for something?

02:00.010 --> 02:01.070
Your Highness,

02:01.090 --> 02:02.920
please never say the word "beg".

02:10.820 --> 02:13.200
Find that assassinator

02:13.370 --> 02:15.170
and kill him.

02:15.650 --> 02:16.540
You don't want to get more information from him?

02:16.540 --> 02:17.570
I was having a talk

02:17.570 --> 02:19.170
with Zhuang Mohan

02:19.290 --> 02:20.800
and he saw it.

02:20.820 --> 02:21.910
Your Highness.

02:21.930 --> 02:23.910
I made a deal with Zhuang Mohan

02:23.930 --> 02:25.370
and told him Yan Bingyun is from

02:25.370 --> 02:26.730
the Investigator's Office.

02:27.060 --> 02:28.690
Did you get it?

02:30.420 --> 02:31.730
Yes.

02:33.700 --> 02:34.490
If you want to do your bit

02:34.490 --> 02:36.550
as an imperial guard,

02:36.570 --> 02:38.610
you can report it to His Majesty now.

02:38.700 --> 02:40.250
I won't blame you.

02:41.370 --> 02:42.830
You can do

02:42.850 --> 02:44.450
whatever you like.

02:46.370 --> 02:48.200
That year, my family was all killed

02:48.340 --> 02:49.920
in that mountain village

02:50.060 --> 02:51.920
and I was starving to death.

02:52.340 --> 02:54.270
If you hadn't passed by and saved me,

02:54.290 --> 02:56.200
I must have died.

02:56.730 --> 02:58.040
I owe you a life.

02:58.060 --> 03:00.090
I'm ready to pay you back anytime.

03:01.490 --> 03:02.780
I'll always stay by your side

03:02.780 --> 03:05.450
and serve you

03:05.490 --> 03:07.240
even if you're condemned

03:07.260 --> 03:08.610
by everyone else someday.

03:18.570 --> 03:20.000
Stand up.

03:24.340 --> 03:25.350
Your Highness.

03:25.370 --> 03:26.260
Go ahead.

03:26.260 --> 03:29.400
I think that guy is Fan Xian, judging from his figure.

03:30.980 --> 03:32.690
Fan Xian?

03:33.090 --> 03:34.990
He wore a mask. It's hard to tell.

03:35.010 --> 03:37.600
But they're similar in figure and height.

03:37.620 --> 03:38.550
In the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest,

03:38.570 --> 03:39.730
Fan Xian joined the poetry contest and got drunk.

03:39.730 --> 03:40.800
He was carried home.

03:40.820 --> 03:41.850
It couldn't be him.

03:41.850 --> 03:44.250
Let's make a conclusion after having a look.

03:44.780 --> 03:46.800
If he isn't at home right now,

03:46.820 --> 03:48.610
it must be him.

03:50.340 --> 03:51.690
Go there now.

03:51.850 --> 03:53.270
If anyone stops you,

03:53.290 --> 03:54.960
tell them it's me that sent you there.

03:54.980 --> 03:56.370
Got it.

03:59.980 --> 04:01.280
Your Highness,

04:01.420 --> 04:02.700
why did you tell him

04:02.700 --> 04:03.830
about Zhuang Mohan?

04:03.850 --> 04:05.610
It's impossible to hide it from him.

04:56.300 --> 04:58.240
You're all thumbs.

04:58.260 --> 04:59.440
Be careful.

04:59.460 --> 05:00.860
Don't spill

05:00.860 --> 05:02.640
the porridge.

05:03.650 --> 05:05.570
Honestly! Ruoruo.

05:05.980 --> 05:07.190
Madam.

05:07.210 --> 05:08.640
You're still here?

05:08.930 --> 05:11.250
Yeah. I am.

05:11.420 --> 05:13.200
How is it going with Fan Xian?

05:13.820 --> 05:16.440
He... He's still sleeping.

05:16.460 --> 05:18.290
I'll come in.

05:21.580 --> 05:23.040
Is he sleeping?

05:24.770 --> 05:26.190
Have you stayed up all night

05:26.210 --> 05:28.090
to take care of him?

05:28.210 --> 05:29.760
I'm good.

05:31.330 --> 05:31.930
He drank too much

05:31.930 --> 05:33.870
last night,

05:33.890 --> 05:35.400
so I got up early

05:35.420 --> 05:37.290
and made some porridge cooked for him.

05:41.740 --> 05:42.960
Fan Xian...

05:42.980 --> 05:44.520
He's still sleeping.

05:44.540 --> 05:46.020
He caught a slight cold last night.

05:46.020 --> 05:47.840
I've got one more quilt for him.

05:47.860 --> 05:49.750
And the medicine is being decocted.

05:49.770 --> 05:51.370
He can take it when he wakes up.

05:58.740 --> 06:02.410
Do you want to have a look at him?

06:03.420 --> 06:04.140
Nah.

06:04.140 --> 06:05.880
Let him sleep.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.980
You'd better go back and have a rest.

06:07.980 --> 06:09.250
I'll stay.

06:09.980 --> 06:11.410
I'm good.

06:11.650 --> 06:12.540
I don't understand

06:12.540 --> 06:14.030
some poems I read last night.

06:14.050 --> 06:16.130
I want to ask him when he wakes up.

06:16.860 --> 06:18.130
You...

06:19.860 --> 06:21.010
Madam.

06:22.020 --> 06:23.370
Keep it down.

06:30.090 --> 06:31.310
There is something else

06:31.330 --> 06:32.870
I need to take care of.

06:32.890 --> 06:34.160
You...

06:34.370 --> 06:35.920
Madam, please go ahead.

06:36.540 --> 06:38.130
I'll leave you alone.

06:57.140 --> 06:58.910
Someone wants to see Fan Xian so early in the morning?

06:58.930 --> 06:59.840
Exactly.

06:59.860 --> 07:01.010
Who is it?

07:01.140 --> 07:02.170
Madam, it's him.

07:02.170 --> 07:03.370
This is the backyard. Don't...

07:03.370 --> 07:04.880
You can't break in.

07:07.330 --> 07:08.850
I once saw you.

07:08.890 --> 07:10.070
You're an imperial guard.

07:10.090 --> 07:12.070
I'm Yan Xiaoyi, Director of Imperial Guards.

07:12.090 --> 07:13.570
Let me pay my respect to you.

07:14.170 --> 07:15.000
So,

07:15.020 --> 07:17.130
are you here to search my house by His Majesty's order?

07:17.170 --> 07:18.150
Of course not.

07:18.170 --> 07:19.960
Princess Royal

07:19.980 --> 07:21.470
asked me to see Fan Xian.

07:21.490 --> 07:22.680
As you know,

07:22.700 --> 07:24.840
it's better to get such matters done without delay.

07:24.860 --> 07:25.980
But it's so early.

07:25.980 --> 07:27.190
Why are you in such a hurry?

07:27.210 --> 07:29.880
It's because Her Highness thinks highly of him.

07:30.370 --> 07:31.310
Madam,

07:31.330 --> 07:34.070
shall I wake His Lordship up?

07:34.090 --> 07:35.920
I just want to make sure he's alright

07:35.980 --> 07:37.050
and ask him a few questions.

07:37.050 --> 07:38.850
Then I'll go back.

07:40.330 --> 07:41.690
Don't bother.

07:41.770 --> 07:43.200
Follow me.

08:05.930 --> 08:07.250
Ruoruo.

08:07.300 --> 08:08.050
Someone from the imperial palace

08:08.050 --> 08:10.040
is here to visit Fan Xian.

08:12.490 --> 08:13.520
Ruoruo?

08:13.540 --> 08:15.880
Check if he's woken up.

08:26.980 --> 08:28.760
This is Director Yan.

08:31.420 --> 08:32.710
He's still sleeping.

08:32.730 --> 08:33.680
I won't wake him up.

08:33.700 --> 08:34.730
I'll just go inside and have a look at him.

08:34.730 --> 08:36.280
Then my job will be done.

08:36.370 --> 08:38.250
Please step slightly.

08:43.660 --> 08:45.680
Lady Ruoruo, please step aside.

08:45.700 --> 08:47.000
He's not well.

08:47.020 --> 08:48.350
You'd better see him later.

08:48.370 --> 08:49.720
Please forgive me.

08:51.460 --> 08:52.260
Yan Xiaoyi, what are you doing?

08:52.260 --> 08:53.970
I'm sorry, but I'm under orders to do that.

08:53.970 --> 08:55.350
Here is the mansion of the Assistant
Minister of Ministry of Revenue.

08:55.370 --> 08:58.130
Her Highness has no right to do that to an imperial officer.

09:12.220 --> 09:14.710
Lady Ruoruo, what are you afraid of?

09:14.730 --> 09:16.470
I have good hearing.

09:16.490 --> 09:18.150
I don't think I can hear anyone breathing

09:18.170 --> 09:20.130
in the room.

09:24.340 --> 09:25.890
Ruoruo.

09:26.170 --> 09:28.370
Let him in.

09:42.580 --> 09:43.950
Sorry.

09:43.970 --> 09:46.690
I drank too much last night.

09:47.410 --> 09:50.080
I have such a massive hangover that I can't get up.

09:50.780 --> 09:52.210
Besides,

09:53.340 --> 09:55.150
I'm a sound sleeper

09:55.170 --> 09:57.130
and I have quiet breathing.

09:58.140 --> 09:59.560
Director Yan,

09:59.580 --> 10:02.010
how about listening to it more carefully?

10:04.370 --> 10:06.080
Do you mind leaving us alone?

10:06.100 --> 10:08.080
Her Highness asked me to pass on a message to Fan Xian.

10:08.100 --> 10:09.120
It's ridiculous!

10:09.140 --> 10:10.200
It's okay.

10:10.220 --> 10:12.960
Madam. Ruoruo.

10:13.020 --> 10:13.700
Help me

10:13.700 --> 10:15.710
withdraw the curtains.

10:15.730 --> 10:18.160
I'll have a talk with Director Yan.

10:18.370 --> 10:21.040
Please wait outside.

10:37.610 --> 10:39.080
Madam.

10:48.850 --> 10:50.280
Take off your clothes.

10:54.490 --> 10:55.350
These guys

10:55.370 --> 10:56.930
really need more discipline.

10:56.930 --> 10:58.520
They're running wild.

10:59.580 --> 11:01.250
Ruoruo, are you okay?

11:02.700 --> 11:04.040
I'm good.

11:08.730 --> 11:10.480
I'm not into that.

11:10.730 --> 11:12.440
An assassinator sneaked into the palace.

11:12.460 --> 11:13.510
Really?

11:13.530 --> 11:14.370
Is it caught?

11:14.370 --> 11:15.600
No.

11:17.340 --> 11:18.260
It can be considered

11:18.260 --> 11:19.960
your neglect of duty, right?

11:20.220 --> 11:22.120
The assassinator was shot in the back of his waist.

11:22.140 --> 11:23.650
He must be injured.

11:23.730 --> 11:25.120
Show me your back.

11:25.140 --> 11:26.640
Are you suspicious of me?

11:26.660 --> 11:27.800
I believe it's you.

11:27.820 --> 11:28.530
Do you have evidence?

11:28.530 --> 11:29.590
No.

11:29.610 --> 11:30.950
Are you doing that by His Majesty's order?

11:30.970 --> 11:31.700
No.

11:31.700 --> 11:34.010
Then why should I do as you said?

11:34.050 --> 11:35.400
Are you afraid of being found out?

11:42.050 --> 11:43.450
You pushed my sister

11:43.850 --> 11:46.010
at the gate, right?

11:46.490 --> 11:48.560
I'll say sorry to her later.

11:48.580 --> 11:50.880
Kneel down and confess in front of her.

11:50.900 --> 11:52.210
What?

11:52.460 --> 11:54.010
Let's make a bet.

11:54.730 --> 11:56.600
I'll take off my clothes.

11:57.100 --> 11:59.040
If I'm injured,

11:59.100 --> 12:00.640
you can take me to the Ministry of Penalty,

12:00.660 --> 12:01.460
the Supreme Court,

12:01.460 --> 12:02.440
the Investigator's Office,

12:02.460 --> 12:04.370
or any other place you want.

12:04.460 --> 12:06.400
If I'm not injured,

12:07.260 --> 12:08.590
you kneel down

12:08.610 --> 12:10.160
and give a kowtow to Ruoruo.

12:10.660 --> 12:12.270
Why do I have to bet with you?

12:12.290 --> 12:13.720
Then you can leave.

12:17.580 --> 12:19.570
I can look at it myself.

12:22.490 --> 12:24.250
Do you know

12:24.660 --> 12:26.240
how many poems

12:26.260 --> 12:27.720
I wrote last night?

12:35.260 --> 12:37.160
Do you know how His Majesty
and other officials will punish you

12:37.370 --> 12:39.270
if you hurt me at this moment?

12:39.290 --> 12:40.150
I don't care.

12:40.170 --> 12:42.210
Even if the Princess Royal will get into trouble?

12:48.370 --> 12:50.450
If you don't dare to bet,

12:51.820 --> 12:55.080
push the door open and get out.

12:55.370 --> 12:56.920
Are you trying to scare me?

12:59.580 --> 13:01.010
You're thinking too much.

13:01.730 --> 13:03.200
Fine. I'm in.

13:03.220 --> 13:04.690
Show me your back.

13:10.820 --> 13:12.400
What if

13:12.730 --> 13:14.840
the assassinator is not injured although it's shot?

13:15.700 --> 13:17.570
Aren't you worried about it?

13:18.050 --> 13:19.350
Even a Great Master will be injured

13:19.370 --> 13:22.210
if he's shot by me with an arrow.

13:23.410 --> 13:24.920
I see.

13:45.340 --> 13:48.040
Director Yan, will you keep your promise?

14:04.460 --> 14:05.960
I'm sorry.

14:11.370 --> 14:12.640
Director Yan.

14:12.660 --> 14:14.650
How about staying here for breakfast?

14:16.290 --> 14:17.950
What's going on?

14:17.970 --> 14:19.690
He pushed Ruoruo.

14:19.970 --> 14:22.010
This is the least price he should pay.

14:22.730 --> 14:24.700
You're protective of your sister.

14:24.700 --> 14:26.440
Madam. Ruoruo.

14:26.460 --> 14:27.590
I'm still sleepy.

14:27.610 --> 14:28.680
I want to have more sleep.

14:28.700 --> 14:31.010
Okay. Go have a rest.

14:31.730 --> 14:32.340
Xian.

14:32.340 --> 14:34.810
It's okay. Go back.

14:35.700 --> 14:37.080
Let's go.

14:53.900 --> 14:55.920
Don't hold it back. Spit it out.

15:12.900 --> 15:14.440
Luckily, I met you on the way.

15:14.460 --> 15:15.410
I had to hurry back

15:15.410 --> 15:16.220
and came in

15:16.220 --> 15:17.270
without letting Yan Xiaoyi know.

15:17.290 --> 15:18.390
Neither of them was easy.

15:18.410 --> 15:19.770
You're shot with an arrow.

15:19.970 --> 15:20.660
Yes.

15:20.660 --> 15:21.710
Yan Xiaoyi's arrow.

15:21.730 --> 15:22.680
I'm not sure.

15:22.700 --> 15:24.450
He said so.

15:24.820 --> 15:25.680
There is no wound.

15:25.700 --> 15:28.480
Uncle, do you want me to be injured?

15:32.930 --> 15:34.810
He was not exaggerating.

15:37.260 --> 15:38.470
Even a Great Master would be injured

15:38.490 --> 15:40.150
if he's shot with Yan Xiaoyi's arrow.

15:40.170 --> 15:41.800
He's the only Ninth Dan archer or above

15:41.820 --> 15:44.080
in the world.

15:44.490 --> 15:46.590
It's a coincidence that the arrow was blocked off

15:46.610 --> 15:47.960
when it was shot in my waist.

15:58.370 --> 15:59.650
The key?

16:00.530 --> 16:02.010
Exactly.

16:02.050 --> 16:03.470
Yan Xiaoyi's arrow

16:03.490 --> 16:05.690
can even make cast iron break.

16:06.820 --> 16:09.160
But the key is not damaged.

16:09.290 --> 16:11.330
I don't know what it's made of.

16:16.730 --> 16:18.370
Have you got everything done?

16:19.100 --> 16:20.400
Almost.

16:21.530 --> 16:22.640
I didn't have enough time

16:22.660 --> 16:23.880
to put the counterfeit back.

16:23.900 --> 16:25.130
Why not?

16:26.660 --> 16:27.660
I saw the Princess Royal

16:27.660 --> 16:28.760
had a secret meeting with Zhuang Mohan

16:28.780 --> 16:30.270
and heard some secrets.

16:30.290 --> 16:31.140
The Princess Royal

16:31.140 --> 16:32.390
made a secret deal with Beiqi

16:32.410 --> 16:33.270
and betrayed Yan Bingyun

16:33.290 --> 16:34.800
to get Xiao En back.

16:34.820 --> 16:35.880
Do you know?

16:35.900 --> 16:36.560
Xiao En is

16:36.580 --> 16:38.210
Zhuang Mohan's younger brother.

16:38.460 --> 16:39.260
So, why didn't you

16:39.260 --> 16:41.080
put the counterfeit back?

16:43.410 --> 16:44.720
Fine.

16:45.260 --> 16:46.800
Anyway, there is almost nothing

16:46.820 --> 16:48.720
you really care about.

16:51.290 --> 16:52.260
Don't worry.

16:52.260 --> 16:53.270
I'll find a way

16:53.290 --> 16:54.690
to put it back.

17:05.100 --> 17:07.080
What's most important,

17:07.500 --> 17:08.500
I'll finally know

17:08.500 --> 17:11.250
what's in the box

17:11.530 --> 17:13.650
my mom left.

17:16.530 --> 17:19.960
Your memory. You open it.

17:20.890 --> 17:23.030
But what's inside

17:23.050 --> 17:25.200
may not be left for me.

17:27.930 --> 17:29.410
We don't know until it's opened.

18:31.930 --> 18:33.410
Why are you laughing?

18:33.740 --> 18:35.080
Uncle,

18:35.380 --> 18:36.720
you don't know

18:37.100 --> 18:38.440
how ridiculous

18:38.460 --> 18:40.230
life can be

18:40.250 --> 18:41.960
in the world.

18:42.010 --> 18:43.270
You sound surprised.

18:43.290 --> 18:44.320
Well.

18:44.340 --> 18:45.630
Do you know

18:45.650 --> 18:47.580
how many resources and years

18:47.580 --> 18:49.410
it'd take to make this?

18:52.250 --> 18:54.170
Over ten years have passed.

18:54.740 --> 18:56.230
Does it still work?

18:56.250 --> 18:57.680
No idea.

19:03.620 --> 19:05.130
Let's have a try.

19:09.250 --> 19:11.750
Your Majesty, it's my fault.

19:11.770 --> 19:13.600
The assassinator's whereabouts is unknown.

19:13.740 --> 19:15.150
But I'm sure

19:15.170 --> 19:16.890
he's shot with my arrow.

19:18.290 --> 19:19.930
Tell him about it.

19:22.410 --> 19:23.560
There are two assassinators.

19:23.580 --> 19:26.370
One of them slipped into the imperial harem beforehand.

19:26.500 --> 19:28.080
And I chased the other out of the imperial palace.

19:28.410 --> 19:30.170
With hindsight,

19:31.100 --> 19:33.080
it was a trick to lure the tiger from the mountain.

19:33.130 --> 19:34.230
Did you catch him?

19:34.250 --> 19:35.200
No.

19:35.220 --> 19:37.250
He even ran away from you.

19:37.380 --> 19:38.440
Is he a Great Master?

19:38.460 --> 19:40.960
Judging from his skill, he's just reached the Ninth Dan,

19:40.980 --> 19:42.800
but he was quick.

19:43.050 --> 19:45.770
The swordsmanship he used is Si Gujian.

19:45.860 --> 19:47.370
Si Gujian?

19:48.410 --> 19:50.480
The mission of Dongyi Town is still in the capital city.

19:50.500 --> 19:51.650
Is it Yun Zhilan?

19:51.650 --> 19:52.990
It couldn't be him.

19:53.010 --> 19:54.320
Is it possible

19:54.340 --> 19:55.870
he used Si Gujian to mislead us?

19:55.890 --> 19:56.870
No.

19:56.890 --> 19:58.390
That guy has grasped

19:58.410 --> 19:59.890
the essence of Si Gujian.

20:00.340 --> 20:02.560
It must've had something to do with Dongyi Town.

20:04.250 --> 20:05.320
Your Majesty,

20:05.340 --> 20:06.480
let's search the mission.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.150
Even if it's not Yun Zhilan,

20:08.170 --> 20:09.720
it must've been someone related to him.

20:09.740 --> 20:11.510
Do you have evidence?

20:11.530 --> 20:13.150
We will as long as we catch the two assassinators.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.800
What if you fail to do that?

20:14.820 --> 20:16.080
It...

20:16.250 --> 20:18.910
The two assassinators sneaked into
the imperial palace late at night

20:18.930 --> 20:20.440
and escaped unscathed.

20:20.460 --> 20:21.560
If it spreads around,

20:21.580 --> 20:24.600
it'd be unbearable shame for us.

20:25.050 --> 20:26.770
I acknowledge my sin.

20:26.890 --> 20:28.770
Seeing that guy is skilled at Si Gujian,

20:28.770 --> 20:30.080
I couldn't help

20:30.100 --> 20:31.320
to see more

20:31.340 --> 20:33.250
so that I chased him for a long time.

20:33.340 --> 20:35.100
Actually, it's my fault.

20:35.100 --> 20:37.050
Before you admitted your fault,

20:37.050 --> 20:39.250
you'd better think about why they wanted to kill Li Yunrui.

20:39.740 --> 20:41.560
Of course to create chaos in the capital.

20:41.580 --> 20:42.960
And then?

20:42.980 --> 20:44.030
That's right.

20:44.050 --> 20:45.560
If they did it,

20:45.580 --> 20:46.910
what's the point of killing a Princess Royal

20:46.930 --> 20:49.250
for Dongyi Town?

20:54.530 --> 20:55.910
You can leave.

20:55.930 --> 20:57.170
Got it.

21:06.500 --> 21:07.600
See?

21:07.620 --> 21:09.410
I said it doesn't work.

21:10.410 --> 21:14.080
It can't be opened.

21:17.620 --> 21:19.370
The password is correct.

21:19.820 --> 21:21.130
We opened it.

21:21.770 --> 21:23.560
Why?

21:23.580 --> 21:24.440
Uncle.

21:24.460 --> 21:25.820
It gives me a reason

21:25.820 --> 21:26.560
to believe

21:26.580 --> 21:27.410
there is some hidden secret

21:27.410 --> 21:29.130
between you and my mom.

21:32.010 --> 21:34.080
I really can't remember.

21:34.380 --> 21:35.930
You don't need to say anything.

21:36.740 --> 21:38.320
Let me have a look at

21:38.580 --> 21:40.930
what she had left.

21:53.050 --> 21:55.200
Are you sure it's not Fan Xian?

21:55.220 --> 21:56.800
It couldn't be him.

21:57.130 --> 21:58.460
As I said,

21:58.460 --> 21:59.620
Fan Xian joined the poetry contest

21:59.620 --> 22:00.680
and got drunk.

22:00.700 --> 22:02.530
How could it be him?

22:02.580 --> 22:06.030
Two assassinators worked together?

22:06.050 --> 22:08.770
It might have something to do with Dongyi Town.

22:09.250 --> 22:11.320
What did they want to do?

22:12.290 --> 22:14.170
To kill me?

22:14.250 --> 22:16.370
His Majesty also had doubt about that.

22:25.290 --> 22:29.600
Xiaoyi, it doesn't make sense.

22:33.890 --> 22:36.770
Find a way to tell Zhuang Mohan

22:37.220 --> 22:39.080
and ask him to leave Nanqing.

22:39.100 --> 22:40.680
The sooner the better.

22:40.820 --> 22:42.130
Got it.

22:57.770 --> 23:01.480
Something has gone wrong, right?

23:04.170 --> 23:06.080
I have to think about it.

23:18.890 --> 23:20.480
The iron is great,

23:21.650 --> 23:23.720
but I wonder in which way

23:23.980 --> 23:26.250
it was made to become like this.

23:27.530 --> 23:29.170
I also wonder

23:29.770 --> 23:31.930
why on earth

23:32.650 --> 23:34.530
she left this stuff.

23:38.130 --> 23:39.800
To kill people.

23:42.130 --> 23:47.010
To kill people? It doesn't have sharp blades.

23:47.530 --> 23:48.840
Do you know something about it?

23:48.860 --> 23:50.370
Yes.

23:52.500 --> 23:53.840
Uncle.

23:56.650 --> 23:58.990
This is a great weapon.

23:59.010 --> 24:00.200
Weapon?

24:08.650 --> 24:10.480
An unparalleled weapon.

24:20.080 --> 24:21.790
=To Wuzhu=

24:25.980 --> 24:27.250
A letter.

24:28.010 --> 24:31.600
It says "To Wuzhu".

24:36.380 --> 24:37.720
Read it for me.

24:37.740 --> 24:38.990
It's for you.

24:39.010 --> 24:40.320
You can read anything

24:40.340 --> 24:42.080
that belongs to me.

24:43.130 --> 24:44.560
Okay.

24:59.580 --> 25:01.250
Your Excellency.

25:03.220 --> 25:04.440
Trust me.

25:06.220 --> 25:07.250
Trust me.

25:07.250 --> 25:08.750
Okay. Well.

25:08.770 --> 25:10.680
Let's say goodbye here.

25:11.890 --> 25:13.360
Remember what I said.

25:13.380 --> 25:14.770
Take your stuff.

25:14.980 --> 25:16.600
Don't come back to the capital

25:16.620 --> 25:17.910
for the time being.

25:17.930 --> 25:20.320
Don't be recognized.

25:21.340 --> 25:22.440
Don't worry.

25:22.460 --> 25:23.440
I shaved myself

25:23.460 --> 25:24.600
because of this issue.

25:24.620 --> 25:26.080
Nobody would recognize me.

25:26.100 --> 25:27.560
All right.

25:27.980 --> 25:28.910
Go ahead.

25:28.930 --> 25:30.800
You said the horse would be mine.

25:31.050 --> 25:32.480
It's for me.

25:32.500 --> 25:33.720
You have to keep your promise.

25:33.740 --> 25:35.630
I will.

25:35.650 --> 25:36.650
That's great. I'm leaving.

25:36.650 --> 25:37.320
Do you know how much

25:37.340 --> 25:38.360
the horse cost me?

25:38.380 --> 25:40.050
I paid for you.

25:40.050 --> 25:41.380
That's right. You promised.

25:41.380 --> 25:42.890
Don't break your word.

25:42.890 --> 25:44.230
Go. Go. Go.

25:44.250 --> 25:45.330
Go.

25:45.500 --> 25:46.620
Don't tell anyone

25:46.620 --> 25:48.270
about what happened last night.

25:48.290 --> 25:49.680
I know the rules.

25:59.340 --> 26:00.680
Head Chen.

26:01.170 --> 26:03.170
Who is that guy?

26:06.130 --> 26:08.170
Answer me.

26:09.700 --> 26:10.460
What happened

26:10.460 --> 26:12.130
last night?

26:14.250 --> 26:15.870
Who is he?

26:15.890 --> 26:19.010
He's just a locksmith.

26:19.530 --> 26:21.510
Here is the thing, Head Chen.

26:21.530 --> 26:22.770
Yesterday,

26:22.890 --> 26:24.410
I asked him

26:24.410 --> 26:26.440
to unlock the door of someone else's home.

26:26.460 --> 26:27.290
So, I asked him

26:27.290 --> 26:28.840
to get out of here.

26:30.820 --> 26:32.200
Head Chen.

26:32.220 --> 26:32.860
Look.

26:32.860 --> 26:34.110
It's the first time

26:34.130 --> 26:35.680
I stole something.

26:35.700 --> 26:37.290
Please forgive me.

26:38.050 --> 26:39.560
I can send a black knight

26:39.580 --> 26:41.480
to get him back.

26:41.500 --> 26:42.800
Don't.

26:43.100 --> 26:44.100
I just asked him

26:44.100 --> 26:45.650
to make a key.

26:50.460 --> 26:52.480
Did the assassination attempt in the imperial palace

26:52.980 --> 26:54.960
have anything to do with you?

26:56.380 --> 26:58.440
Did it have anything to do with Fan Xian?

27:02.220 --> 27:03.530
No.

27:05.620 --> 27:07.320
No!

27:10.890 --> 27:13.010
Do you know how capable he is?

27:16.460 --> 27:17.480
Yeah.

27:17.500 --> 27:19.370
I'm giving you one more chance.

27:20.890 --> 27:24.680
Is it Fan Xian that did it?

27:33.050 --> 27:34.320
No.

27:52.530 --> 27:53.930
Why don't you read?

27:55.130 --> 27:57.290
The wording

27:57.740 --> 27:59.720
is really special.

28:00.770 --> 28:02.130
I'll begin.

28:03.380 --> 28:06.650
Dear Zhuzhu, let me give you a kiss.

28:06.650 --> 28:08.270
Zhuzhu is me.

28:08.290 --> 28:09.600
I know.

28:13.820 --> 28:15.150
Is it funny?

28:15.170 --> 28:16.770
No.

28:19.890 --> 28:22.290
I like you very much.

28:22.340 --> 28:23.050
I tried many times

28:23.050 --> 28:25.080
to introduce a girl to you,

28:25.220 --> 28:27.930
but you're always like a cold fish.

28:28.500 --> 28:29.630
This madam...

28:29.650 --> 28:31.650
Sorry. You can't call me madam.

28:31.820 --> 28:32.910
I think

28:32.930 --> 28:34.360
you must be very popular among girls

28:34.380 --> 28:36.800
if you smile more.

28:38.620 --> 28:40.440
I think she's right.

28:41.010 --> 28:44.130
Uncle, did she try to fix you up?

28:47.860 --> 28:49.230
I don't remember.

28:49.250 --> 28:50.600
Are you angry?

28:50.860 --> 28:52.250
Why?

28:52.340 --> 28:54.770
Forget about it. I'll continue.

28:55.740 --> 28:56.750
At this moment,

28:56.770 --> 28:58.600
I'm staying in the capital alone.

28:58.620 --> 29:00.890
So I decide to write you a letter.

29:01.100 --> 29:02.440
You wouldn't listen to me

29:02.500 --> 29:04.480
and has gone to fight in that temple again.

29:05.410 --> 29:08.250
I guess you'd lose again

29:08.700 --> 29:10.410
and finally come back.

29:10.740 --> 29:12.010
So,

29:12.250 --> 29:13.250
I'm writing this letter

29:13.250 --> 29:15.010
to laugh at you in advance.

29:23.340 --> 29:26.320
Uncle, you're smiling.

29:27.860 --> 29:29.130
Really?

29:30.650 --> 29:32.360
Did you really go to fight in that temple

29:32.380 --> 29:33.650
and lose?

29:36.580 --> 29:37.910
I think so.

29:37.930 --> 29:39.910
Is it the so-called divine temple?

29:39.930 --> 29:40.800
I don't remember.

29:40.820 --> 29:42.170
Why did you fight?

29:45.050 --> 29:46.290
I don't remember.

29:46.380 --> 29:47.680
What's the relationship between my mom

29:47.700 --> 29:49.170
and you and that divine temple?

29:50.290 --> 29:50.890
Fine.

29:50.890 --> 29:52.800
I guess you don't remember, either.

29:54.460 --> 29:55.960
Let's go on.

29:56.930 --> 29:58.990
I've been worried about one thing.

29:59.010 --> 30:00.750
I'm worried how you'll live in the world

30:00.770 --> 30:03.080
without curiosity or desire

30:03.100 --> 30:05.110
or anything you'd like to do.

30:05.130 --> 30:06.360
So, I decide to leave the letter

30:06.380 --> 30:07.560
in the box

30:07.580 --> 30:09.320
and wouldn't ask you to open it.

30:09.620 --> 30:11.230
If you open it

30:11.250 --> 30:12.910
of your free will someday

30:12.930 --> 30:14.320
and read the letter,

30:14.340 --> 30:15.870
I'd be very happy

30:15.890 --> 30:17.530
and surprised.

30:20.930 --> 30:22.360
Can you tell me

30:22.380 --> 30:23.720
what made you

30:23.740 --> 30:26.080
want to open the box?

30:26.650 --> 30:28.200
Nothing special.

30:29.770 --> 30:31.370
I just want to know

30:32.100 --> 30:33.220
what you left

30:33.220 --> 30:34.960
to the world

30:36.580 --> 30:38.890
and whether you'd mention me.

30:42.700 --> 30:44.010
Uncle Wuzhu.

30:46.410 --> 30:47.960
Go on.

30:56.410 --> 30:58.410
This madam came to this world,

30:58.410 --> 30:59.170
in parenthesis,

30:59.170 --> 31:01.200
this madam means me, your sister.

31:01.220 --> 31:03.510
I came. I saw. I played.

31:03.530 --> 31:04.630
I was once the richest person.

31:04.650 --> 31:06.250
I even...

31:10.050 --> 31:12.200
...pulled the old emperor's beard.

31:12.220 --> 31:14.200
I just didn't unify the whole world.

31:20.170 --> 31:22.250
But what's the point of doing that?

31:23.380 --> 31:24.560
If there is

31:24.580 --> 31:26.290
still something I want to do,

31:26.930 --> 31:28.050
I want to see the world

31:28.050 --> 31:29.890
become a better place

31:30.100 --> 31:32.170
and everyone can

31:32.460 --> 31:34.320
smile more brightly.

31:35.980 --> 31:37.930
It sounds stupid, right?

31:39.170 --> 31:40.680
Don't laugh.

31:41.460 --> 31:42.800
I didn't.

31:47.250 --> 31:48.800
I don't know why,

31:48.820 --> 31:50.840
but I feel like I'm writing my last words.

31:51.290 --> 31:52.720
Zhuzhu,

31:52.740 --> 31:54.480
I don't know how long would pass

31:54.770 --> 31:56.560
when you see the letter

31:56.620 --> 31:58.370
and I don't know if I'd still be alive.

31:58.770 --> 32:00.650
If I'm already dead,

32:02.380 --> 32:04.290
just destroy everything in the box.

32:04.460 --> 32:05.290
I don't need anyone else

32:05.290 --> 32:07.050
to know my story.

32:07.250 --> 32:08.650
They don't deserve it.

32:12.890 --> 32:14.250
Zhuzhu,

32:16.250 --> 32:18.050
actually, you don't understand

32:19.530 --> 32:21.170
where I'm from.

32:23.100 --> 32:26.930
Do you know? I'm lonely.

32:28.340 --> 32:30.130
There are many people in the world,

32:32.340 --> 32:34.560
but I'm lonely.

32:35.580 --> 32:39.930
I'm really lonely.

32:42.930 --> 32:45.130
But luckily, you've been with me

32:47.700 --> 32:49.560
when I felt most lonely.

32:51.740 --> 32:53.170
Zhuzhu,

32:54.170 --> 32:56.170
I really miss you.

33:06.100 --> 33:07.560
That's all.

33:10.460 --> 33:11.890
Do you miss her?

33:16.460 --> 33:18.080
What does it mean?

33:21.130 --> 33:22.770
It...

33:24.700 --> 33:26.680
It means

33:26.890 --> 33:29.080
no matter if you're walking,

33:29.460 --> 33:30.930
eating,

33:32.100 --> 33:32.990
sleeping,

33:33.010 --> 33:34.530
fighting,

33:35.460 --> 33:37.110
or doing something else,

33:37.130 --> 33:39.200
and no matter how many people are around you,

33:39.290 --> 33:40.220
you can't

33:40.220 --> 33:41.720
drive her out of your mind

33:42.620 --> 33:44.650
and you speak her name quietly.

33:46.770 --> 33:48.600
You hear many people speak,

33:49.010 --> 33:50.680
but you just want to hear

33:51.170 --> 33:52.800
her voice.

33:54.130 --> 33:56.250
You've seen many faces,

33:56.700 --> 33:58.370
but you just want to see

33:58.890 --> 34:00.560
her smile.

34:01.250 --> 34:04.930
In this case, you miss her.

34:15.900 --> 34:17.760
I miss her.

34:33.420 --> 34:35.030
Assassinators sneaked in last night?

34:35.050 --> 34:37.160
They showed up at Guangxin Palace.

34:37.180 --> 34:39.640
Did they aim to kill Li Yunrui?

34:39.660 --> 34:41.320
It's still unknown.

34:44.940 --> 34:47.210
She doesn't want to lose control of Neiku.

34:47.770 --> 34:49.840
It makes some guys jealous.

34:49.860 --> 34:51.080
Was everything going well

34:51.660 --> 34:53.930
here last night?

34:55.210 --> 34:57.450
Everything as usual.

34:58.860 --> 35:01.370
And I had a good sleep.

35:02.420 --> 35:04.800
I'm relieved to hear that.

35:11.690 --> 35:12.950
Don't tell anyone else

35:12.970 --> 35:14.890
about Lady Ye's issue.

35:14.970 --> 35:17.080
But I think you're different.

35:18.770 --> 35:20.710
I'll put it back,

35:20.730 --> 35:22.080
but don't throw the box into the river.

35:22.100 --> 35:23.650
It'll be of use sooner or later.

35:25.450 --> 35:27.130
There is one more layer here.

35:37.900 --> 35:39.410
One more letter.

35:40.420 --> 35:43.650
Zhuzhu, don't open this letter.

35:43.770 --> 35:45.000
What is it?

35:45.140 --> 35:46.560
I don't know.

35:48.100 --> 35:49.410
Do you want to open it?

35:52.180 --> 35:53.190
Can I open it?

35:53.210 --> 35:55.280
She didn't say you can't do that.

36:09.250 --> 36:11.280
Hi, my son.

36:11.450 --> 36:13.030
You didn't misread it.

36:13.050 --> 36:15.560
This letter is for you.

36:16.490 --> 36:18.450
I wasn't born

36:18.940 --> 36:20.800
when she wrote it, right?

36:21.730 --> 36:22.970
Right.

36:24.290 --> 36:26.210
How did she know she'd have a son?

36:26.450 --> 36:27.730
She guessed.

36:32.450 --> 36:33.950
Only you can have a chance to

36:33.970 --> 36:35.240
read the letter.

36:36.970 --> 36:38.130
I know.

36:38.420 --> 36:40.360
You have a lot of questions

36:40.380 --> 36:41.470
about yourself,

36:41.490 --> 36:43.170
about me and about the world.

36:43.970 --> 36:46.040
I'll tell you the answer now.

36:46.820 --> 36:48.080
Fan Xian,

36:48.530 --> 36:50.270
there is no time travel

36:50.290 --> 36:52.370
and there is no parallel spacetime.

36:52.530 --> 36:54.270
Here is still the Earth.

36:54.290 --> 36:56.170
It's still our world.

36:58.940 --> 37:00.730
The Earth has never stopped spinning

37:01.100 --> 37:03.600
during the past over four billion years.

37:04.900 --> 37:06.710
During the long period,

37:06.730 --> 37:07.340
several special eras

37:07.340 --> 37:09.000
have appeared.

37:10.180 --> 37:12.410
As global cooling happened substantially,

37:12.770 --> 37:14.080
areas at higher latitudes

37:14.100 --> 37:16.170
witnessed the formation of massive ice sheets.

37:16.380 --> 37:19.240
Water condensed into ice.

37:20.140 --> 37:21.900
Both atmospheric circulation and ocean currents

37:21.900 --> 37:23.760
changed accordingly.

37:23.860 --> 37:25.690
In such an era,

37:25.970 --> 37:28.650
the entire planet went white.

37:29.450 --> 37:31.520
That's called a major ice age.

37:32.450 --> 37:33.920
It's interesting.

37:33.940 --> 37:34.940
It would happen

37:34.940 --> 37:36.520
every once in a while.

37:37.290 --> 37:38.880
In our day,

37:38.900 --> 37:40.690
there was much speculation

37:41.340 --> 37:43.320
about when the next ice age

37:43.450 --> 37:45.000
would arrive

37:45.620 --> 37:47.690
and if humans would become extinct.

38:03.100 --> 38:06.520
Our time has ended.

38:06.820 --> 38:08.370
Fan Xian,

38:08.490 --> 38:10.840
we opened the Forbidden Door.

38:17.770 --> 38:19.840
I hope our time would revive

38:19.860 --> 38:21.650
when a new era arrives.

38:24.450 --> 38:26.600
Have you ever seen a sci-fi movie?

38:28.620 --> 38:29.530
People might be frozen

38:29.530 --> 38:31.040
in an instrument.

38:32.820 --> 38:36.600
Years later, people sleeping inside

38:37.450 --> 38:39.890
would come out as the instrument is opened.

38:42.250 --> 38:43.840
I'm

38:44.730 --> 38:47.130
just a living example.

38:55.140 --> 38:57.240
My mom was revived from a frozen state.

38:57.450 --> 38:58.800
Frozen?

38:59.490 --> 39:01.280
It could be.

39:05.340 --> 39:06.640
When I woke up,

39:06.660 --> 39:09.000
the ice age had been over.

39:09.210 --> 39:11.080
The old days are gone

39:11.100 --> 39:13.160
and new humans have appeared.

39:13.180 --> 39:15.160
They've gone through primitive society

39:15.180 --> 39:17.320
and then slavery society.

39:17.340 --> 39:20.490
Now, they're living in feudal society:

39:21.420 --> 39:22.730
Nanqing.

39:23.340 --> 39:24.730
Have you ever thought about

39:24.730 --> 39:25.660
why people here

39:25.660 --> 39:27.400
also speak Chinese

39:27.420 --> 39:28.420
and behave

39:28.420 --> 39:30.000
like we did in our day?

39:31.860 --> 39:33.730
Because I'm not the only one

39:34.100 --> 39:35.970
who was revived after being frozen.

39:36.940 --> 39:38.140
Many pioneers

39:38.140 --> 39:39.640
survived

39:39.660 --> 39:42.320
and spread civilization to new humans.

39:42.580 --> 39:43.530
It can be considered

39:43.530 --> 39:45.240
some heritage from our time.

39:45.900 --> 39:47.650
Their legends

39:48.380 --> 39:50.120
are the secrets of the divine temple.

39:50.140 --> 39:52.360
What on earth is the Forbidden Door?

39:52.380 --> 39:54.560
Why did it cause an ice age?

39:54.900 --> 39:55.660
How on earth

39:55.660 --> 39:57.230
did humans in our day become extinct?

39:57.250 --> 39:58.190
And,

39:58.210 --> 39:59.600
if I was revived after being frozen,

39:59.620 --> 40:01.450
why did I become a baby?

40:08.690 --> 40:10.880
You're not revived after being frozen.

40:10.900 --> 40:12.560
You're an exceptional case.

40:12.770 --> 40:14.210
Let me put it this way.

40:14.290 --> 40:15.210
We had an experiment

40:15.210 --> 40:17.030
about datamation of memories.

40:17.050 --> 40:18.990
You're one of the guinea pigs.

40:19.010 --> 40:22.040
And you're the only one that made it.

40:23.340 --> 40:25.690
I know you have many questions.

40:25.940 --> 40:27.230
The answer you're looking for

40:27.250 --> 40:27.900
is hidden

40:27.900 --> 40:29.730
in a place called Taiping Residence.

40:29.970 --> 40:31.930
If you've ever been there,

40:32.420 --> 40:34.930
you'd find there is a pond in the yard,

40:35.450 --> 40:36.580
at the bottom of which

40:36.580 --> 40:38.560
is hidden a starting gear.

40:38.660 --> 40:40.170
Through operation of it,

40:40.380 --> 40:40.900
you'd see

40:40.900 --> 40:42.760
a blank door is opened in the house.

40:43.530 --> 40:45.510
From the secrets of the Forbidden Door

40:45.530 --> 40:47.400
to the reason why humans became extinct,

40:47.420 --> 40:48.690
all the answers you're looking for

40:48.690 --> 40:50.170
can be found there.

40:50.900 --> 40:54.210
Go there if you want to find it out.

40:56.900 --> 40:57.770
Personally, I hope

40:57.770 --> 40:59.890
you won't work on these secrets.

41:00.050 --> 41:02.370
If you go behind the Forbidden Door

41:02.420 --> 41:04.000
and find the truth,

41:04.620 --> 41:05.770
you're destined to go back

41:05.770 --> 41:07.840
to where I escaped

41:07.860 --> 41:09.640
and face the most horrible things

41:09.660 --> 41:11.600
underground.

41:12.770 --> 41:14.990
If you stay away from that door,

41:15.010 --> 41:16.690
all these dangers

41:16.690 --> 41:18.730
will have nothing to do with you.

41:19.180 --> 41:20.970
You can enjoy a peaceful,

41:21.340 --> 41:22.990
happy life.

41:23.010 --> 41:26.280
The way you live your life is up to you.

41:26.580 --> 41:28.690
That's all my suggestions.

41:30.580 --> 41:32.170
One more thing,

41:34.530 --> 41:36.600
there is no vitality Qi.

41:37.290 --> 41:38.840
The so-called vitality Qi

41:39.050 --> 41:40.160
is actually something

41:40.180 --> 41:42.130
left from the last era.

41:42.940 --> 41:44.450
By the way,

41:45.820 --> 41:47.520
be nice to Wuzhu.

42:00.690 --> 42:01.710
Did you hear it?

42:01.730 --> 42:02.640
Yes.

42:02.660 --> 42:03.840
The secrets hidden at the bottom of the pond

42:03.860 --> 42:05.320
at Taiping Residence.

42:05.730 --> 42:07.280
Do you want to find it out?

42:08.970 --> 42:10.370
I'm not sure.

42:10.450 --> 42:12.170
She said it's dangerous.

42:13.010 --> 42:15.030
My mind told me not to,

42:15.050 --> 42:16.730
but I'm curious.

42:17.690 --> 42:19.080
What do you think?

42:19.530 --> 42:21.190
Up to you.

42:21.210 --> 42:24.690
She asked me to be nice to you.

42:26.490 --> 42:28.080
I don't understand.

42:29.100 --> 42:30.880
You're a martial arts master.

42:30.900 --> 42:32.600
You don't need me to take care of you, right?

42:55.920 --> 42:59.500
In the river of history,

42:59.520 --> 43:02.990
time goes round and round.

43:05.800 --> 43:09.140
Memories about the former and present lives

43:09.160 --> 43:13.230
join each other in an endless way.

43:15.120 --> 43:17.740
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:17.760 --> 43:20.000
one season follows another in a flash,

43:20.000 --> 43:22.500
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:22.520 --> 43:24.120
I just can't give up

43:24.120 --> 43:27.460
to be with you for my whole life.

43:27.480 --> 43:32.950
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:34.200 --> 43:36.750
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:37.040 --> 43:39.080
Year after year in the wandering,

43:39.080 --> 43:41.740
I count the remaining years.

43:41.760 --> 43:43.940
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:43.960 --> 43:45.950
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:46.240 --> 43:48.630
I never feel regretful.

43:48.680 --> 43:50.040
In such a chaotic world,

43:50.040 --> 43:53.020
I still miss you as ever.

43:53.040 --> 43:55.990
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:56.280 --> 43:58.340
With a gentle heart,

43:58.360 --> 44:01.020
I cherish our remaining years.

44:01.040 --> 44:02.560
Even though we have to go through

44:02.560 --> 44:05.070
all the hardships along the journey,

44:05.200 --> 44:12.390
you always stay by my side,

44:12.480 --> 44:15.150
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:15.440 --> 44:17.520
Year after year in the wandering,

44:17.520 --> 44:20.180
I count the remaining years.

44:20.200 --> 44:22.340
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:22.360 --> 44:24.590
even though we end up the destiny,

44:24.800 --> 44:26.980
I never feel regretful.

44:27.000 --> 44:28.400
In such a chaotic world,

44:28.400 --> 44:31.460
I still miss you as ever.

44:31.480 --> 44:34.590
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:34.680 --> 44:36.820
With a gentle heart,

44:36.840 --> 44:39.540
I cherish our remaining years.

44:39.560 --> 44:41.000
Even though we have to go through

44:41.000 --> 44:43.660
all the hardships along the journey,

44:43.680 --> 44:52.440
you always stay by my side...
